1Style: Kanji-furigana-OPı,Duality,18,&H00D8933F,&H000000FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,2,0,8,10,10,80,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, Text﻿[Script Info]; Script generated by Aegisub 3.2.2; http://www.aegisub.org/Title: Default Aegisub fileScriptType: v4.00+WrapStyle: 0ScaledBorderAndShadow: yesYCbCr Matrix: TV.601PlayResX: 640PlayResY: 480Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Editing FeesoDialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Timing KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:09.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Quality Control Feeso Galaxy 9000 Pepperjack SewilDialogue: 0,0:00:09.73,0:00:11.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Soundtracking HaleeDialogue: 0,0:00:11.73,0:00:13.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Graphics DatenshiDialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:15.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Karaoke KaitouYahikoDialogue: 0,0:00:15.73,0:00:17.73,Credits-480p,,90,0,60,,Translation Gaijin FUNimationDialogue: 0,0:02:59.53,0:03:03.57,Captions-480p,,0,0,5,,Captain "White Hound" Smoker Navy HeadquartersDialogue: 0,0:01:56.97,0:01:59.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker! Terrible news!Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.43,0:02:01.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We received a message from headquarters!Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.09,0:02:06.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy and his crew are headed here, to Loguetown!Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.23,0:02:10.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He just earned a 30-million-belly bounty in the East Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.65,0:02:14.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,30 million... That's almost admirable.Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:15.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He's an incredibly wicked rogue;Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.40,0:02:18.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,he defeated Don Krieg and the fishman Arlong!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:19.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Quiet!Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:28.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Damn your shouting. You made it fall apart.Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:29.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:35.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I think it's best to do things at your own pace.Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,, It's a mistake to be so flustered.Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:36.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.65,0:02:37.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.65,0:02:44.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Then why so tense?Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.13,0:02:45.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right!Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:50.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's just been a while since such a formidable pirate group showed up!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.82,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Has a single pirate been able to escape this town...Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:58.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,since I took command?Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:02:59.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,N-No, sir...Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.49,0:03:03.57,Main-480p,,0,0,1,, Then calm the hell down. You're gonna screw up my pace.Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.57,0:03:04.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:09.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Reporting in, sir! We have word that    pirates have appeared at the port!Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.53,0:03:11.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Please head there immediately!Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:15.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It must be Luffy's group! They've already arrived!Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.51,0:03:19.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,30 million, huh...  I hope he at least puts up a fight.Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.47,0:03:20.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sir?Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just talking to myself. Forget it.Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:26.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna look at this?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.31,0:03:31.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,"Justice"Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain! Please give each unit their orders!Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.89,0:03:34.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No need.Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.95,0:03:37.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But you need to consider how powerful he is!Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Never mind that. Where's Tashigi?Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.99,0:03:44.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. She mentioned she'd be busy this morning,Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:47.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but that she'd attend the training drills.Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:50.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That clumsy girl. Where'd she run off to?Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yay! Three scoops!Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:54.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Slow it down! You'll drop them if you run!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.51,0:04:05.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,C-Captain Smoker!Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:07.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,M-My ice cream.Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.11,0:04:09.56,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I-I'm very sorry about my daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:13.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.43,0:04:18.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Sorry 'bout that. My pants ate your ice cream.Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.70,0:04:20.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here, buy yourself five scoops.Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.87,0:04:22.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's go.Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:23.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.99,0:04:27.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-Thank you!Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:28.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:36.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Loot everything! Don't leave a single potato behind!Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.23,0:04:40.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I, Gally the Crescent-sama, will need these food supplies...Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:43.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,to become king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:46.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hand it all over!Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.37,0:04:47.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey.Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:49.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Who's in charge here?Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:51.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What do you want?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:54.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're Monkey D. Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:05:00.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you have what it takes to survive in my town.Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.61,0:05:02.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Cut the crap!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.95,0:05:04.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Get 'im!Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:15.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker?Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:18.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He was one of the toughest guys from Navy HQ.Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.95,0:05:23.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This town used to be a haven for pirates headed to the Grand Line.Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:28.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But ever since he took command, every pirate who's come to town...Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:31.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,has wound up behind bars.Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.45,0:05:34.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,His strength is extraordinary. He's a monster.Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:38.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,They even say he has devil fruit powers.Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.99,0:05:40.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Devil fruit powers?!Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:50.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Incredible, Captain! You captured Luffy's crew in no time flat!Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:54.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Are your eyes just for decoration? This guy obviously isn't Luffy.Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:55.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Eh?Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.52,0:05:59.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The world would end before this guy is worth 30 million.Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:01.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-Then, where is Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.26,0:06:05.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He'll show up soon enough. The fun's just getting started.Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.72,0:06:07.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:12.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How did I wind up at the harbor? Seriously?Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.15,0:06:13.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.22,0:06:16.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is he one of these guys?Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.44,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't think so...Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:22.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing! Do you know how to get to the execution platform?Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:23.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The execution platform?Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for it.Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.75,0:06:27.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I've never seen you around here before.Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:30.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I just arrived on this island!Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:34.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This town sure is huge! It's way  different from Foosha Village!Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.86,0:06:36.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why're you looking for the execution platform?Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.66,0:06:40.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I wanna see the place where the pirate king died!Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.13,0:06:46.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So you don't know where? Well...Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:49.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wait. Follow the smoke.Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.97,0:06:53.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh! That way?! Thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.57,0:07:12.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This sucks.Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:14.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I keep trying to get to the execution platform,Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.54,0:07:17.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but I keep getting lost.Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:20.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, well. I'll get there sooner or later.Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is it this way?Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.45,0:07:25.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's see...Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.55,0:07:29.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold... Roger?Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.97,0:07:51.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Do you work here, old guy?Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:55.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It said "Gold Roger" on the sign outside.Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is that this place's name?Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.33,0:07:59.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Scram.Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:02.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This ain't a place for a runt like you.Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:06.08,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Besides, we're closing for good today.Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:08.08,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're going under?Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:11.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We're not going under! I'm shutting it down myself!Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:13.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now get lost!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.05,0:08:16.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I was just curious about the name.Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:21.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get to the execution platform but I keep getting lost.Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.28,0:08:23.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me how to get there?Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's that on the table?Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:29.98,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A skull?! It's huge!Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.98,0:08:34.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is what's left of Killer Giant.Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.99,0:08:39.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A fiend who sent hundreds of pirates to the afterlife.Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:45.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Until Gold Roger finished him with just one blow.Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:47.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger did?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.03,0:08:48.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,With lightning-like speed!Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is the wound he received!Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He was a terrible man anyway,Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:58.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but with his dying breath, he conceded,Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.05,0:09:01.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,"Roger... I take my hat off to you;Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:04.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,you will always be honored among pirates."Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.35,0:09:07.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So awesome! That's cool!Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:12.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,When I heard he had conquered the Grand Line a little later,Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.21,0:09:16.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I wasn't surprised, just happy and excited he was the one to do it.Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.55,0:09:24.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,22 years ago today, Roger died  on that execution platform.Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.11,0:09:28.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,And ever since that day, every cocky upstart...Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:30.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,has tossed their hat into the pirate ring.Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:33.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was the beginning of the Great Pirate Era!Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.39,0:09:36.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But look what's happened!Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.68,0:09:40.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This town's full of nothing but cowards and scum now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.95,0:09:45.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Men crazy enough to challenge that evil sea are all but gone now!Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:49.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's why this bar is closing for good today.Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:52.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm going to the Grand Line!Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:53.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger's so cool...Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:57.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He's how a pirate should be!Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:10:00.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's why I set out to sea.Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.03,0:10:03.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go to the Grand Line, find the One Piece,Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.62,0:10:05.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,and become king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.42,0:10:16.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Those're some mighty big words! And in this bar, of all places!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.85,0:10:19.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I only said what I meant.Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.97,0:10:23.98,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Kiddo! If there're still patrons like you out there,Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:26.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,should I hold off on closing this place?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:28.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How should I know if there are?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.06,0:10:31.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're right! There's no way of knowin'!Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.61,0:10:34.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I haven't been in this good a mood for ages!Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.35,0:10:36.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll treat you to a drink!Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.82,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't drink alcohol.Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:42.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Alright! Then how about this?Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:47.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's have a toast! To the eternal king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.57,0:10:53.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here's to the king of the pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:09.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Amazing! That's an elephant bluefin tuna!Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:13.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's right! It probably got mixed in from the southern waters.Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I caught it with a pole and line!Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.34,0:11:16.78,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A pole and line?!Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.61,0:11:19.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,An elephant bluefin tuna...Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:22.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, haul it away.Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.23,0:11:23.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:24.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on a second!Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:25.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hm?Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:28.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How much is it?! Let me buy it!Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.73,0:11:32.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I got a lotta good stuff!Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:36.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now my preparations to be a brave warrior of the sea are complete!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:39.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All I've got left is...Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.49,0:11:42.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I forgot the most important thing!Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.61,0:11:43.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Goggles!Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.59,0:11:46.56,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A first-class sniper needs to have first-class goggles!Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's a necessity!Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:50.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I gotta spare no expense on these goggles...Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.59,0:11:54.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,if I'm gonna be a first-class sniper!Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:56.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Goggles! Goggles!Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:09.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is it! These goggles are perfect! It's gotta be these!Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.87,0:12:10.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Lady!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:14.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You got a good eye! Them's the latest model from the North Blue!Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:18.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I got 'em from a naval import ship that only visits once a year!Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.80,0:12:20.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? You got no money?Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.87,0:12:22.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I don't do business with people who don't got cash!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:23.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:24.82,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,N-No, it's...Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:26.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh! Right! My backpack...Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.09,0:12:28.10,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'll take these goggles, please!Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.10,0:12:30.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My! What a cute little girl!Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:31.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes! You're in luck!Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.96,0:12:35.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,This is the only pair in town!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:38.02,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I was here first!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.59,0:12:44.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Butt out, old man!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.24,0:12:45.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,O...Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Old man?Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.54,0:12:54.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop right there, you!Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:57.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Listen! First things first! There's no way I'm an old man!Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.06,0:12:59.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm more like a big brother. Got it?Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:01.32,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What're you talking about, old man?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Dammit, you said it again!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:05.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just gimme those goggles already!Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.09,0:13:06.82,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:09.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You got a problem?! Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.05,0:13:11.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Keep up yer damn complainin' and I'll call the marines!Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:12.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,M-Marines?Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:16.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yep! The town's naval captain is like a family friend.Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:18.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The old smoky man!Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.90,0:13:20.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,W-Who is this girl?Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.17,0:13:23.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't you know who I am?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:27.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm the great Captain Usopp! I destroyed Arlong's Fishman Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.82,0:13:29.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was truly a battle to the death!Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.06,0:13:31.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There I was, surrounded by 200, no, 300 fishmen!Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.13,0:13:35.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I beat them all mercilessly single-handed!Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:40.38,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, I now have a 30-million-belly bounty on my head!Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.27,0:13:43.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Really? 30 million...Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.20,0:13:45.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yep! That's right!Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:46.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa!Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:49.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa?! I'm not your papa!Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here's a present for you, Papa!Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:56.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh, Carol...Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:04.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What a considerate little angel you  are! I love you, Carol-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:06.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa! I love you, Papa!Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:15.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But this old man was being mean and trying to swipe your present!Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.34,0:14:19.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now, now! You mustn't say "swipe"!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:22.00,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Remember your manners, okay?Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:27.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Are you the gentleman who's picking on my precious Carol?Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:30.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,P-Picking on?Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.68,0:14:31.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's not all!Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.74,0:14:33.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:38.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You have a bounty of 30 million belly, I hear?Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:40.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's see here...Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.57,0:14:42.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Are those the new wanted posters?Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.69,0:14:45.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just picked 'em up from the naval outpost...Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:51.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,600,000... 1,300,000... 700,000...Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:53.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,30 million... Straw Hat Luffy?Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:57.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,For a starting bounty to be this high...Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:14:59.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hold it, boy.Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:02.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Yes?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:03.40,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No, you see, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:07.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm obviously not the person on that poster! I was just lying!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:10.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was just a silly little prank! Well, bye!Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.68,0:15:13.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's you.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.85,0:15:17.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,T-T-That's right! It sure is! That's me, all right!Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.36,0:15:20.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But I have to warn you! If you lay a hand on me,Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,my captain Luffy won't stand for it!Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:26.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He's an awful, cold-blooded, devilish man!Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.61,0:15:29.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No one's ever crossed him and lived to tell the story!Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:33.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You got a kid, right? You shouldn't be risking your life...Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:35.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I see. It doesn't sound worth it.Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.55,0:15:39.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's clear that this Luffy fellow is no ordinary man,Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:42.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,since he has a bounty of 30 million.Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:45.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa! You're obviously way stronger!Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're the strongest in the whole wide world!Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Carol. It's all right.Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.25,0:15:53.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to prove and your safety is far more important to me.Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:56.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,As long as I earn enough to provide for us, I'm happy.Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.97,0:15:58.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa...Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.52,0:16:07.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So you realize how terrifying I am?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.23,0:16:10.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Take my advice! Just hand the  goggles over and move on!Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:16.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! I'll pay for 'em! So just give 'em here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:20.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,He was just about to let you go, you-!Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:21.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa?Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.45,0:16:22.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Then let's resolve this.Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.20,0:16:26.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I assume you have no problem with us settling this like gentlemen?Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.75,0:16:27.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen?Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:28.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:32.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-You're not talking about a duel, are you?Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:35.72,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If you win, the goggles are yours.Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.45,0:16:40.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6... 30 pistols?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:42.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me you're...Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.51,0:16:44.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Daddy the Father?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:45.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,A duel!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.90,0:16:47.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's gonna be a duel!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Daddy the Father's gonna face somebody!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.23,0:16:51.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Did he say Daddy the Father?Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:56.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Daddy the Father is like the greatest gun-slinging bounty hunter out there!Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:58.21,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everyone in the East Blue knows that!Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:03.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So what kind of idiot would challenge him to a duel?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.63,0:17:07.88,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Oh. that kind.Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.88,0:17:09.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Good luck, long nose!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.80,0:17:13.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't worry if he beats ya! We already got a place dug for ya!Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:22.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The rules are simple. We both walk  ten paces and then turn and shoot.Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.45,0:17:23.32,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.32,0:17:25.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.03,0:17:25.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:29.06,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Facing Daddy the Father in a duel... Are you suicidal?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:32.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,S-Shut up! It just happened!Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:35.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You get one shot. Are you ready?Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.47,0:17:46.47,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,One!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:49.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Two!Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.97,0:17:51.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Three!Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.19,0:17:53.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Four!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.01,0:17:55.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Five!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.68,0:18:02.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Six!Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:08.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Seven!Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:18.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Eight!Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:21.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Later!Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.19,0:18:41.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa! You're amazing, Papa! You're so cool!Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.22,0:18:42.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Man, how pathetic.Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:44.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What a lame duel.Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:48.60,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I thought he'd have more guts than that. What a disappointment.Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:51.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What's with you?! Tryin' to cheat like that!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.27,0:18:55.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You cowardly weakling! Can't you at least fight honestly?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.05,0:18:59.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! Forgive me! I'm just a lowly, pathetic man!Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:02.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You'd get nothing out of killing someone like me!Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:03.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right?! Right?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.17,0:19:05.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Can't you just let me go?Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.23,0:19:08.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.53,0:19:09.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Nami!Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:13.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,R-Right! If it's money you want, she has plenty!Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just please don't shoot me! Please spare my life!Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:17.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec!Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.70,0:19:20.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now you're groveling behind a woman?Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:22.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Anyway-Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:25.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No! Forget what I just said!Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.49,0:19:27.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,She's an innocent bystander!Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:31.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't drag her into this,  even if it means I get shot!Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.41,0:19:32.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp...Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:34.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Please! Leave her out of it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.15,0:19:35.66,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,"Usopp?"Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:37.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is your name Usopp, boy?Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:38.61,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah.Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:41.22,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It couldn't be...Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:46.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Do you know a man named Yasopp of the Red Hair Pirates?Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:49.82,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yasopp? That's my old man's name.Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:52.62,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-You've met my dad before?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.05,0:19:55.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I see. You're his son...Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:57.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa?Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.35,0:20:03.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I've never once told a soul what happened on that day,Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:06.14,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but I'll make an exception.Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:11.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It happened in a sweltering port town like this.Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:15.48,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Let's do it, Ensign Masterson! We each get one shot!Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:19.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,One! Two! Three!Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.53,0:20:37.42,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Kill me! I have no reason to live now I've lost.Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:43.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:44.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Your daughter?Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.51,0:20:45.90,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Give it back...Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:50.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,To think a marine like you would treasure something like this...Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.18,0:20:51.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You must really spoil her.Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:54.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't lecture me, you filthy pirate!Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.57,0:20:56.07,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.48,0:20:59.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You were great, Yasopp!Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.81,0:21:01.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was nothin'.Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:03.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The wound I took shows I have a lot to learn.Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:06.41,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You beat Daddy Masterson though!Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.41,0:21:08.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You won because you're already awesome!Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.95,0:21:11.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we never would've stood a chance...Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.50,0:21:14.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boss!Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.09,0:21:18.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you watching the duel!Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.75,0:21:26.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff! You want some, Ensign?Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.85,0:21:31.52,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Family, huh...Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.52,0:21:34.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Havin' a family's not so bad. But I'm no good at it.Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.81,0:21:35.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.87,0:21:39.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I got a son of my own. His name's Usopp.Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:40.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Haven't seen him in years now.Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.68,0:21:44.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I hit the high seas around the time he was a toddler.Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.37,0:21:48.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Why? Don't you love him?Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.75,0:21:50.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It wasn't like that.Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:54.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was about the flag...Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.97,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I heard the call of the Jolly Roger.Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.97,0:21:59.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You tell 'im, Yasopp!Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:05.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,At this point,Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.39,0:22:11.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,there's nothing I can do for my son.Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:15.98,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,We don't need another hopeless father like me out there!Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.87,0:22:21.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Stay by your daughter's side if you  can. Don't let her get lonely.Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:24.27,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Though I probably shouldn't talk!Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:32.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I lost our duel! Yasopp! Finish me!Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:35.18,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't give me your lousy pity!Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.18,0:22:36.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Forget it!Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.69,0:22:40.75,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You marines might have to hang your enemies,Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.75,0:22:44.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but us pirates are free to kill or spare who we please!Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.63,0:22:45.80,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,See ya!Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.10,0:23:03.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa! You didn't really lose to a pirate, did you?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:08.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But that's amazing! Your dad must be really skilled!Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.67,0:23:09.32,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp?Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:11.28,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Seriously?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.28,0:23:14.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Would you normally tell someone like me...Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:16.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,about when your life was spared?!Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.69,0:23:22.35,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You told me that to give me courage!Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.35,0:23:25.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Most people would be too ashamed to tell a story like that,Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.57,0:23:28.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,but you told me about it anyway!Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.22,0:23:33.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Just so I would know what my old man is like!Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.94,0:23:36.89,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No weakling or coward could do what you just did!Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:41.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Carol! Your dad is the bravest man alive!Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.43,0:23:43.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You can find strong guys anywhere!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:48.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,But the ones who'd risk their honor for others are rare!Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:57.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I... I can't give in, either! I gotta be  brave, or I'll shame your dad!Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:23:59.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Daddy! Give me another chance!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.43,0:24:02.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Face me in another life or death duel!Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.31,0:24:03.96,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I won't cheat this time!Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.69,0:24:12.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All right. This will be our real showdown.Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:15.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Choose the weapon you're most comfortable with.Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.26,0:24:21.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Good. Now, then. Let's see...Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.15,0:24:27.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Try and hit that weathervane.Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.74,0:24:29.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Weathervane? That?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.19,0:24:34.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Miss it, and...Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:37.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! You can shoot me right through the heart!Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:37.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.07,0:24:42.37,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My life is on the line for real this time!Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.79,0:24:48.19,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's...Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.19,0:24:51.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's no way he can hit it with that thing.Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.23,0:25:13.64,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You missed!Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.64,0:25:16.36,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,No, Papa! Don't shoot him! Papa!Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.75,0:25:22.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't shoot him 'cause he shot right through its crown!Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.89,0:25:26.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Y-You really did it! He's right!Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.41,0:25:28.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Usopp!Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.83,0:25:32.30,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're an excellent shot. I'd expect no less of Yasopp's son.Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.30,0:25:35.76,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,If you hold onto the bravery you just showed,Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.76,0:25:38.26,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,you'll be just like your old man someday!Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.37,0:25:43.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Go to the Grand Line. I'm certain Yasopp is there.Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.87,0:25:44.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Daddy...Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.31,0:25:49.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're pretty good, old man!Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.51,0:25:50.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Aren't these...Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.41,0:25:53.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's okay! See ya!Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.50,0:25:54.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Papa!Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.57,0:25:56.68,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Carol, you know that's not lady-like.Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.68,0:25:58.91,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's poor manners to say, "see ya!"Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.91,0:26:00.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Right! Sorry, Papa!Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.95,0:26:04.70,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm going to grow up to be a proper lady worthy of being your daughter!Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.70,0:26:05.94,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,So please forgive me!Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.94,0:26:09.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You're already worthy the way you are!Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.17,0:26:10.54,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm still going to be an even nicer lady!Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.54,0:26:13.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Even if people consider him a disgrace,Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.15,0:26:17.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,he'll continue to protect the one he loves.Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.13,0:26:21.17,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be a brave man like Daddy!Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.17,0:26:25.81,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Someday I'll be a great warrior and stand before my dad proudly!Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:29.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I know it!Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.97,0:26:38.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You?!Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.20,0:26:41.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is that any way to greet...Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.23,0:26:43.95,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,your only regular patron?Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.83,0:26:47.77,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't blame me.Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.77,0:26:50.50,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I only come here as a loyal customer.Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.50,0:26:54.34,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's not my fault that the pirates around here are cowards now.Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.03,0:26:59.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You had a customer? That's rare.Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.09,0:27:03.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I'd like some rum.Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.85,0:27:06.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There's no booze here for you!Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.05,0:27:10.73,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that. Today's a special day.Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.39,0:27:13.63,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.45,0:27:19.99,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff.Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.01,0:27:25.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can still see it like it was yesterday.Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.73,0:27:29.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,How Roger looked at the very end...Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.12,0:27:32.45,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It was a humid afternoon, just like today...Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.23,0:27:38.25,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,His hands were shackled as he was led down the main street...Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.25,0:27:40.23,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,towards the town square, where the execution platform stood.Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.23,0:27:43.71,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Yet, he waltzed along like it was a victory parade.Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.75,0:28:15.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power...Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.93,0:28:20.08,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger obtained everything the world had to offer.Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.08,0:28:22.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Even though he was walking towards death,Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.55,0:28:25.85,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,he acted like it was his coronation.Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.65,0:28:29.31,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The tides of time,Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.31,0:28:32.83,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,humanity's dreams and inherited will...Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.83,0:28:36.13,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,As long as people seek freedom,Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.13,0:28:39.57,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,these things will never cease to be.Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.01,0:28:50.03,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Do you have any last words?!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.07,0:28:56.16,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Mind taking these off? They're beginning to chafe.Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.16,0:28:57.43,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,I can't do that!Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.43,0:28:59.09,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You think I would run?Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.49,0:29:03.05,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Guess I'm on my own.Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.51,0:29:10.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,All right,  let's get this over with.Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.73,0:29:28.20,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pirate King!Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.49,0:29:31.87,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Where did you hide all the treasure you found?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.87,0:29:34.12,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Is it in the Grand Line?!Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.53,0:29:38.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,You had it, right?! That legendary treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.58,0:29:40.04,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you!Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.04,0:29:42.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That great treasure!Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.63,0:29:47.49,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The One Piece!Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.10,0:29:58.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My treasure?Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.69,0:30:00.01,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Don't speak without permission!Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.01,0:30:02.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,It's yours, if you can find it.Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.15,0:30:07.15,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everything is right where I left it!Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.65,0:30:44.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's how it all began...Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:48.11,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.11,0:30:51.39,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Hey, here's a new wanted poster! Put it where people can see it!Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.65,0:30:55.29,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,C-Captain Smoker! Pardon the intrusion, sir!Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.41,0:31:00.46,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,U-Umm...Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:02.67,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That's a straw hat...Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.07,0:31:05.55,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,That kid was Monkey D. Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.61,0:31:12.51,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,There it is...Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.17,0:31:19.79,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The place where the greatest pirate in history died.Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.27,0:31:22.58,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The place where it all began.Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.58,0:31:24.93,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.61,0:30:07.15,Secondary-480p,,0,0,0,,Execute!!Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.48,0:14:09.13,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,W-What's with this family?Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:02.81,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,The guy's backing off 'cause of what I said!Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.52,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:19.39,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,H-How did things turn out  like this? What's wrong with me?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.37,0:17:58.59,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,This is bad... Really bad...Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.59,0:18:01.68,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can possibly beat Daddy the Father.Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:07.69,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,Am I going to die here?! This can't be happening!Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.11,0:18:12.71,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,I just started on my journey!Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.71,0:18:14.30,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,I haven't even had the chanceDialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:16.99,Thoughts-480p,,0,0,0,,to build up any courage or manliness yet!Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.33,0:01:53.46,Title-480p,,0,0,0,,ParallelsDialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.69,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Wealth, fame, power...Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:05.65,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger, the king of the pirates,Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:07.86,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,obtained everything the world had to offer.Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:11.74,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,His final words lured all sorts of adventurers to the sea.Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:15.53,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,My treasure?  It's yours, if you can find it.Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.53,0:00:19.24,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Everything is right where I left it!Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.54,0:00:26.33,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,Now pirates head for the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams!Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:27.84,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,The world has entered...Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:29.59,Main-480p,,0,0,0,,the Great Pirate Era!Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.08,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.08,0:00:30.33,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.68,0:00:30.08,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:30.08,0:00:34.92,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.73,0:00:34.67,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 2,0:00:34.67,0:00:34.97,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,We'Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.78,0:00:34.72,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 2,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.02,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,re goDialogue: 1,0:00:29.83,0:00:34.77,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 2,0:00:34.77,0:00:35.07,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx,ingDialogue: 1,0:00:29.88,0:00:34.82,Lyrics-OPı,,0,0,0,fx, toDialogue: 2,0:00:34.82,0:00:35